{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfZZE1LvMM3KvsVmtmPtJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```\n<<PHASE:DESIGN>>\n```\n\n**Proposed change, file by file:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** (ErrorCode enum)\n   - Add `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM` error code for when attempting to confirm a CANCELLED shipment\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt**\n   - Add a new method `confirm(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment`\n   - Route: `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm`\n   - Logic:\n     - Find shipment by ID; throw `ResourceNotFoundException` if not found\n     - If status is `CANCELLED`, throw `ConflictException` with the new error code\n     - If status is `CREATED`, update to `CONFIRMED` and save\n     - If status is `CONFIRMED`, do nothing (idempotent)\n     - Return the shipment\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt**\n   - Add test: confirm a CREATED shipment → moves to CONFIRMED (201 or 200?)\n   - Add test: confirm an already CONFIRMED shipment → succeeds with no change\n   - Add test: confirm a CANCELLED shipment → returns 409 with error code\n   - Add test: confirm a non-existent shipment → returns 404 with error code\n\n**Alternative rejected:**\n- Creating a separate service layer - simpler to keep the logic in the controller like the existing `create` and `getById` methods\n- Using a `ConfirmShipmentRequest` DTO - not needed since no body is required\n- Returning 204 No Content instead of the shipment - the ticket says \"returns the shipment\", so 200 OK with body\n\n**Data and error flow:**\n\n| Case | Read | Write | Response | Code |\n|------|------|-------|----------|------|\n| CREATED → CONFIRMED | find shipment | update status, save | 200 OK + Shipment | 200 |\n| CONFIRMED (idempotent) | find shipment | (none) | 200 OK + Shipment | 200 |\n| CANCELLED | find shipment | (none) | 409 Conflict | SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM |\n| Not found | (none) | (none) | 404 Not Found | SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND |\n\n**Test strategy:**\n\n1. **test: confirms a CREATED shipment to CONFIRMED** - Verifies the core functionality, status changes from CREATED to CONFIRMED\n2. **test: confirm is idempotent for CONFIRMED shipment** - Confirms calling confirm twice on the same shipment succeeds both times\n3. **test: rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with conflict** - Verifies 409 response with correct error code\n4. **test: rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404** - Verifies ResourceNotFoundException is thrown\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:IMPLEMENTATION>>\n```\n\nNow I'll implement the changes:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":993,"cache_read_input_tokens":17478,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":993},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5f4cc45-03f1-4812-afc5-8194131e3c45","uuid":"555c7a1e-0a96-4760-9fcf-d93d8b78318a","timestamp":"2026-09-30T11:37:11.241Z","request_id":"req_011CfZZDzy6dQL6ti6ELs1hk"}
